  accept 4283                         -- Oralius: the Blackrock orcs drop the medallions, keep it open all through the Steppes
  turnin 3823                         -- Oralius
  accept 3824

step Blackrock Medallion on the way
  along until q3701
  collect 11467 quest 4283.1

step Thaurissan Relic on the way
  along until q3701
  when onquest 3701
  interact 153556 quest 3701.1

step Level 51.39
  when level<51.39
  tip Top up here to level 51.39 before the hand-ins at Flame Crest: they take you to level 52.
