# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Flame Crest and the Ruins of Thaurissan

step Flame Crest
  tip Follow the road west, then climb north to the goblin camp on Flame Crest.
  accept 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil
  accept 4296                         -- Maxwort Uberglint

step Level 52
  when level<52
  tip Top up here to level 52 before the hand-ins at Flame Crest: they take you to level 53.
  goto 78.7,44.7 map 1428 "Firegut Ogre Mage"
  level 52                          -- grind on Firegut Ogre Mage

step Ruins of Thaurissan: kill these as you meet them
  label q3701
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip The relics are the carved stones scattered through the Ruins of Thaurissan around Flame Crest: click them until the information is recovered.
  tip Read the tablet in the Dark Iron camp among the ruins, south-west of Flame Crest, to copy the transcript.
  tip Use the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a Black Broodling on the slopes east of Flame Crest just before it dies, then loot the essence it leaves.
  interact 153556 quest 3701.1        -- Thaurissan Relic
  collect 12283 quest 4726.1
  collect 11467 quest 4283.1
  use 12284 quest 4726.1 @72.4,28.2 map 1428
  collect 11470 quest 4296.1

step Flame Crest
  turnin 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil
  accept 4808                         -- Ends with Felnok Steelspring in Everlook, Winterspring: keep it
  turnin 4296                         -- Maxwort Uberglint

step Cyrus Therepentous
  when group 4023
  accept 4023                         -- Below ground

step A Taste of Flame
  when group 4023
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Frenzied Black Drake is a level 54 elite: most classes solo it at level 56, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 10575 quest 4023.1 @94.4,31.8 map 1428

step Cyrus Therepentous
  when group 4023
  turnin 4023                         -- Below ground

step Level 52.08
  when !group 4023
  when level<52.08
  tip If you skipped A Taste of Flame, grind here to level 52.08 to stay on the route's plan.
  goto 89.6,51.2 map 1428 "Ember Worg"
  level 52.08                          -- grind on Ember Worg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Blackrock Stronghold

step Blackrock Stronghold
  tip Gor'tesh and the Blackrock orcs hold the camps and the stronghold at the foot of Blackrock Mountain, west of Flame Crest. Pull them one at a time; every orc and worg may drop a medallion, so kill them until you have fifty.
  tip Careful: Gor'tesh has a guard linked to him that joins the fight, and a second soldier patrols close by; clear the patrol before pulling.
  collect 11467 quest 4283.1          -- Blackrock Medallion; inside
  collect 11080 quest 3824.1          -- Gor'tesh

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back to the Vigil

step Morgan's Vigil
  tip Ride back east along the road to the Vigil.
  turnin 4283                         -- Oralius
  turnin 3824
  accept 3825

step Dreadmaul Rock
  tip Climb to the top of Dreadmaul Rock and plant the head in the soft dirt mound.
  interact 160840 quest 3825.1        -- Soft Dirt Mound

step Morgan's Vigil
  turnin 3825                         -- Oralius
  vendor nearest

step Fly to Nethergarde Keep
  zone Burning Steppes
  goto 84.4,68.3 "Morgan's Vigil flight master"
  fly "Nethergarde Keep"
  zone Blasted Lands

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Blasted Lands

step Kum'isha the Collector
  tip Kum'isha waits at the Rise of the Defiler, the hill south-west of the keep. The Blasted Lands mobs on the way drop the Imperfect Draenethyst Fragments; bring her what you have.
  tip Careful: Felcular, Razelikh the Defiler and Ilifar are all level 60 elites. Razelikh casts Mana Burn, Strong Cleave and Decimate, and as its health drops it adds Razelikh's Tear, Flames of Chaos and then Enrage at 15%.
  accept 3501                         -- Kum'isha the Collector walks around here: look inside the circle on the map
  collect 10593 quest 3501.1
  turnin 3501

step Hearth to Stoutlager Inn
  when bound "Stoutlager Inn"
  hearth "Stoutlager Inn"

step To Stoutlager Inn
  when !bound "Stoutlager Inn"
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 35.5,48.4 "Stoutlager Inn"

step Loch Modan
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 18.2,84.0 "Loch Modan"

step Mountaineer Pebblebitty
  when group 3181
  turnin 3181
  accept 3182

step Loch Modan
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 33.9,50.8 "Loch Modan"

step Fly to Ironforge
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 33.9,50.8 "Thelsamar flight master"
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge

step Curator Thorius
  when group 3181
  turnin 3182

step Ironforge
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
